      <p>To the recruitment team,</p>
<p>Hello Sunblink,</p>
<p>I am writing about your opening for Environment Gameplay Designer.</p>
<p>My name is Matthieu Huguet and I work as a freelance Technical Artist, specializing in procedural environments and pipelines between Houdini and Unreal Engine 5.</p>
<p>Holding a Game Design Bachelor from LISAA Paris and a Game Art Master’s from ARTFX Montpellier, alongside specialized coursework at Gnomon and Harvard CS50, I combine an understanding of design imperatives with the technical rigor of production tooling.</p>
<p>In production, I have notably collaborated with Meerkat Studio on several simulation titles shipped on Steam (including Santa Simulator and Bakery Coffee Simulator) and on unannounced commercial contracts. I handled technical environment integration, real-time lighting, and asset optimization to maintain a stable framerate. Earlier during my studies, I co-developed Noyes (graduation game), before delivering real-time visualization missions for private clients. All my work is documented at matthieuhuguet.com.</p>
<p>My daily focus is designing parametric HDAs and automation scripts (Python, VEX) that empower level designers and environment artists to iterate rapidly without hitting pipeline bottlenecks:</p>
<p>Your opening for Environment Gameplay Designer lines up with my day-to-day work: Houdini, Unreal Engine, Python, PCG, Blueprints and C++.</p>
<p>Your track record for high-impact visual and technical delivery requires resilient pipelines and friction-free workflows for creative teams. This is exactly what I bring to Sunblink: removing friction for your artists by building dependable, production-ready procedural systems.</p>
<p>I’m currently looking for freelance Technical Artist missions via my own structure, and I can take on a defined scope (tools, pipeline integration, or environment production) on a short or long engagement.</p>
<p>I would be happy to walk you through my tools and talk with you by video call, whenever suits you.</p>
<p>Matthieu Huguet Technical Artist · Houdini &amp; Unreal Engine 5 matthieuhuguet.com · linkedin.com/in/zenray</p>
