<li>Modular Houdini-to-UE5 generators (architecture, parametric stairs kits, tiles, and floor variations).</li>
<li>Optimized real-time shaders, modular Vertex Paint master materials, and foliage deformation via Vertex Animation Textures (VAT).</li>
<li>Procedural texturing systems in Copernicus and Substance Designer adhering to strict isotropic texel density to maximize visual fidelity while reducing memory footprint. My latest published work: Fleur de Lys: Procedural Lily, Houdini to Unreal, Ceramic Tiles and HDA Stairs Component.</li>
